    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math>  <br/>From comparing the power on both side <br/><math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/>From the above three equations we will get <br/><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo>&amp;</mo><mi> </mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
